    {
      "id": "3C1EC3247EF677FF",
      "title": "The Oathless",
      "description": [
        "Right-click an Oath Shard in a clear area to call the tagged Oathless trial. Ordinary husks never count; the archive recovers memories but cannot award a victory. Defeat this enemy once for the first-victory reward; earlier kills are not retroactively counted by this new kill objective."
